<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39369" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ptĕrygĭum</span></b> ,
			ĭi, n., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πτερύγιον</span>. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A film that grows over the eye</i>, <i>a pearl</i>, <i>web</i>, or <i>haw</i>, <i><span class="en">Cels. 7, 7, 4</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 32,
				7, 24</span></i>. § 72; 34, 10, 23, §
			105.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A growth of flesh over the nails</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 24, 4,
				5, § 9</span></i>; <i><span class="en">26, 5, 14, § 26</span></i>; <i><span class="en">27, 4, 5, §
			20</span></i>; 30, 12, 37, § 111; cf. <i><span class="en">Cels. 6,
				19, 1</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>III.</b>
			<i>A cloudy spot in the beryl</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 37, 5,
				20, § 79</span></i>. </div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
